* ''The deps move before the founding'' (operator rulings, 2026-11-01: //"I want to collide those old holds"//, then //"Approve both leans pending the trials, flow on"//). The engine holds read as claims under test: Automerge moves to 3.5.0 if its trial reads green, Keyhive to 0.6.0 as the one port before the founding if its trial shows the CGKA standing from the Archive and the port runs one or two days, else 0.3 holds; `vitest` 5.0.5 and the hygiene bumps ride the same lane. Subduction and Onomancy stay out, and a TiddlyWiki re-pin stays an epoch act. Landed, PR #151 (#/o-takiage): Automerge moved to 3.5.0, and Keyhive holds 0.3 on its trial's red; the tail rides #/side-lanes.

